<title>NETHERLANDS: UNILEVER SAYS CONCLUSIONS CAN'T BE DRAWN FROM Q4.</title>
<headline>UNILEVER SAYS CONCLUSIONS CAN'T BE DRAWN FROM Q4.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever NV/Plc said on Tuesday few conclusions could be drawn from its fourth quarter results.</p>
<p>&quot;Few conclusions can be drawn from this quarter's results, due to the impact of the different phasing of exceptional items in 1996 as against 1995,&quot; it said in a statement accompanying fourth-quarter and full-year 1996 results.</p>
</text>
